00:23:51.280 --> 00:23:55.070
ichido-kiri nara dekiru hazu da kara
I know I can do it, if only just once

00:23:57.240 --> 00:24:01.120
kon'ya reiji no basu ni nottara
If I can make it to the bus stop by midnight

00:24:03.460 --> 00:24:07.750
ichido-kiri nara dekiru hazu da kara
I know I can do it, if only just once

00:24:09.260 --> 00:24:12.430
This story is fiction...

00:24:09.260 --> 00:24:12.430
but in 10 years, who knows?

00:24:18.680 --> 00:24:21.980
Shaft Security Systems
is on the move! Hey Noa!

00:24:21.980 --> 00:24:22.690
What?

00:24:22.690 --> 00:24:25.400
What are you doing
eating at a time like this?!

00:24:25.400 --> 00:24:28.610
Once things get going, we're bound for
a head-on collision with these clowns...

00:24:28.610 --> 00:24:30.320
so I'm gonna fuel up while I can.

00:24:30.320 --> 00:24:33.950
Utsumi, 3S, and Division 2 have a
rendezvous on the battlefield.

00:24:34.240 --> 00:24:38.030
Night turns to day as
the first barrage is fired off!

00:24:38.160 --> 00:24:41.540
